# Line endings (workspace rule, see CLAUDE.md "Line endings"): the repository
# stores LF and working copies use LF too, so what generators, scripts and
# editors write already matches and Git prints no "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# warnings, although this machine's Git sets core.autocrlf=true.
# cmd.exe needs CRLF in batch files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
